COMPILATION OF: E52F

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52F

   1 a 0000 E52F:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-52/P1] DIFFERENT NAMES, SAME IMAGE ACROSS SCOPES: outer a
   4 a 0006      fixed dec(4,2) stores 3, inner b fixed dec(4,2) stores 3. No
   5 a 0006      homonym, compiles today. The image-keyed dedup [C178] is
   6 a 0006      name-blind, so a program-wide pool predicts ONE 3-byte cell
   7 a 0006      (DATA 3 pool + 3 + 3 = 9); per-scope pools give two (12).
   8 a 0006      Together with A this separates scope-keyed from image-keyed
   9 a 0006      dedup independent of shadowing. */
  10 c 0006   dcl a fixed dec(4,2);
  11 c 0006   a = 3;
  12 c 0016   call q;
  13 c 0019   q: procedure;
  14 e 0019      dcl b fixed dec(4,2);
  15 e 001C      b = 3;
  16 c 002D      end q;
  17 a 002D end E52F;

CODE SIZE = 0030
DATA AREA = 0009
FREE SYMS = 38A9
END  COMPILATION
